              then
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi τ
                    %mo ∘
                    %mi B
                    %msup
                      %mi i
                      %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tau\circ B i^*
              hence
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi B
                    %msup
                      %mi i
                      %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B i^*
              is injective. One can calculate
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
