              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Weyl+group"} Weyl group
              of the maximal torus
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
